<section class="cuk-how" data-how-to aria-label="How to use CurtainsUK">
  <header class="how-hero">
    <div class="how-hero-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">A LITTLE GUIDANCE, AT YOUR PACE</p><h1>Find your way.<br><em>Make it yours.</em></h1><p>From a first fabric idea to a room coming together. Explore our tools with simple, visual walkthroughs.</p><a class="how-button" href="#fabric-intelligence">Show me where to start <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><p class="how-quiet">Choose a guide below. Take one step at a time.</p></div>
