</nav><div class="how-walkthrough-heading"><div><p class="how-eyebrow">SEE HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>Small steps. A clearer picture.</h2></div><p>These illustrated examples explain the tools.<br>Open a feature when you are ready to use it.</p></div><div class="how-panels">
<article id="fabric-intelligence" class="how-panel how-sage" data-guide="fabric-intelligence" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="fabric-intelligence-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>01 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-fabric"><div class="how-fabric-photo"><img class="" src="{{ 'cuk-home-bedroom-daylight.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Curtains in a softly lit bedroom" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><div class="how-swatch-row" aria-label="Illustrative fabric colours"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="how-fabric-note"><span>YOUR FABRIC DIRECTION</span><p>A palette that feels like home.</p></div></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Tell us what matters</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">Fabric Intelligence</p><h2 id="fabric-intelligence-title">Find your fabric direction</h2><p class="how-intro">A few choices about your room can make a big collection feel manageable.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Tell us what matters"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Tell us what matters</strong><span>Choose what you need from your curtains and the feeling you want for the room.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Set your direction"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Set your direction</strong><span>Explore pattern and price preferences. Add room colours where offered.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: Explore your suggestions"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>Explore your suggestions</strong><span>Look at the fabrics, check their details and order samples before deciding.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/apps/curtainsuk-decision/consultation?experience=premium&amp;entry=guided">Try Fabric Intelligence<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">Suggestions are a starting point. Fabric details and current availability still matter.</p></div></article>
<article id="browse-fabrics" class="how-panel how-rose" data-guide="browse-fabrics" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="browse-fabrics-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>02 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-browse"><div class="how-fabric-photo"><img class="" src="{{ 'cuk-home-bedroom-daylight.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Curtains in a softly lit bedroom" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><div class="how-swatch-row" aria-label="Illustrative fabric colours"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="how-fabric-note"><span>COLOUR · TEXTURE · PATTERN</span><p>One collection. Your own way in.</p></div></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Search or explore</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">Browse Fabrics</p><h2 id="browse-fabrics-title">Follow a colour. Find a favourite.</h2><p class="how-intro">See the collection at your own pace, from quiet textures to expressive prints.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Search or explore"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Search or explore</strong><span>Start with a design, colour or supplier, or simply browse the collection.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Narrow your selection"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Narrow your selection</strong><span>Use the available filters and open a fabric to see its colourway and details.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: Bring it into your home"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>Bring it into your home</strong><span>Order an available sample or continue to Make Curtains where offered.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/pages/fabric-library?view=browse-fabrics">Browse the fabrics<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">Look at samples in your own light. On-screen colour is only a guide.</p></div></article>
<article id="room-visualiser" class="how-panel how-blue" data-guide="room-visualiser" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="room-visualiser-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>03 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-room"><svg class="how-window" viewBox="0 0 500 340" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a window with curtains and measurement guides"><rect x="115" y="50" width="270" height="240" rx="6" fill="#d4e1de"/><path d="M250 50v240M115 165h270" stroke="#fffaf2" stroke-width="9"/><path d="M90 40h320" stroke="#504d45" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path class="how-curtain how-curtain-left" d="M90 50h90l-15 250H80z"/><path class="how-curtain how-curtain-right" d="M320 50h90l10 250h-85z"/><path d="M105 55l-8 240m27-240-9 240m28-240-10 240m28-240-10 240M338 55l11 240m10-240 11 240m10-240 10 240" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="5"/><g class="how-dimension" fill="none" stroke="#6b6b48" stroke-width="2"><path d="M90 18h320M90 10v16m320-16v16M448 50v250m-8-250h16m-16 250h16"/></g><text class="how-dimension" x="225" y="14" fill="#56573e" font-size="13">WIDTH</text><text class="how-dimension" x="465" y="188" fill="#56573e" font-size="13" transform="rotate(90 465 188)">DROP</text><rect x="155" y="286" width="190" height="9" rx="4" fill="#d6c6ac"/></svg></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Choose your room</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">Room Visualiser</p><h2 id="room-visualiser-title">See the difference a fabric makes</h2><p class="how-intro">Explore curtain fabrics in a room before settling on your favourites.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Choose your room"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Choose your room</strong><span>Start with Living Room, Bedroom, Lounge or Office.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Try a fabric"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Try a fabric</strong><span>Choose from the visualiser collection and compare the available views.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: Explore the details"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>Explore the details</strong><span>Try the offered room colours and curtain controls. Follow the sample or curtain link when ready.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/pages/room-visualiser">Open the visualiser<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">Rooms are illustrative. Available controls and views depend on the selected fabric profile.</p></div></article>
<article id="naila" class="how-panel how-peach" data-guide="naila" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="naila-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>04 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-naila"><img class="how-portrait" src="{{ 'curtainsuk-naila-portrait.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Naila, AI fabric interior designer" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"><div class="how-chat"><span>LET’S FIND YOUR DIRECTION</span><p>A calm room, a touch of colour, or something full of character?</p><div class="how-pills"><b>Atmosphere</b><b>Colour</b><b>Pattern</b></div></div></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Meet Naila</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">Naila</p><h2 id="naila-title">A little help narrowing it down</h2><p class="how-intro">Meet your AI fabric interior designer within Browse Fabrics.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Meet Naila"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Meet Naila</strong><span>Open Browse Fabrics and choose Continue with Naila to begin.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Share your preferences"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Share your preferences</strong><span>Work through priorities, atmosphere, colour family, pattern and price.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: React and refine"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>React and refine</strong><span>Respond to the fabrics you see, then explore the suggested directions and details.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/pages/fabric-library?view=browse-fabrics">Find Naila in Browse<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">Naila is an AI adviser. Use her suggestions alongside fabric facts and real samples.</p></div></article>
<article id="guided-measure" class="how-panel how-sand" data-guide="guided-measure" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="guided-measure-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>05 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-measure"><svg class="how-window" viewBox="0 0 500 340" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a window with curtains and measurement guides"><rect x="115" y="50" width="270" height="240" rx="6" fill="#d4e1de"/><path d="M250 50v240M115 165h270" stroke="#fffaf2" stroke-width="9"/><path d="M90 40h320" stroke="#504d45" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path class="how-curtain how-curtain-left" d="M90 50h90l-15 250H80z"/><path class="how-curtain how-curtain-right" d="M320 50h90l10 250h-85z"/><path d="M105 55l-8 240m27-240-9 240m28-240-10 240m28-240-10 240M338 55l11 240m10-240 11 240m10-240 10 240" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="5"/><g class="how-dimension" fill="none" stroke="#6b6b48" stroke-width="2"><path d="M90 18h320M90 10v16m320-16v16M448 50v250m-8-250h16m-16 250h16"/></g><text class="how-dimension" x="225" y="14" fill="#56573e" font-size="13">WIDTH</text><text class="how-dimension" x="465" y="188" fill="#56573e" font-size="13" transform="rotate(90 465 188)">DROP</text><rect x="155" y="286" width="190" height="9" rx="4" fill="#d6c6ac"/></svg></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Tell us about the setup</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">Guided Measure</p><h2 id="guided-measure-title">Measure with a clear next step</h2><p class="how-intro">Follow the guide for your fitted pole or track and the curtain finish you want.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Tell us about the setup"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Tell us about the setup</strong><span>Choose your fitted hardware, opening and heading where supported.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Follow the diagrams"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Follow the diagrams</strong><span>Enter raw width and drop readings in centimetres from the illustrated points. Do not add allowances.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: Check your brief"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>Check your brief</strong><span>Check your readings, then download, print or copy your Measurement Brief for review.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/pages/how-to-measure">Start Guided Measure<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">Measure fitted hardware, not just the window. Your brief stays in this browser and is not automatically sent or approved for making.</p></div></article>
<article id="house-of-curtains" class="how-panel how-lilac" data-guide="house-of-curtains" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="house-of-curtains-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>06 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-house"><svg class="how-window" viewBox="0 0 500 340" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a window with curtains and measurement guides"><rect x="115" y="50" width="270" height="240" rx="6" fill="#d4e1de"/><path d="M250 50v240M115 165h270" stroke="#fffaf2" stroke-width="9"/><path d="M90 40h320" stroke="#504d45" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path class="how-curtain how-curtain-left" d="M90 50h90l-15 250H80z"/><path class="how-curtain how-curtain-right" d="M320 50h90l10 250h-85z"/><path d="M105 55l-8 240m27-240-9 240m28-240-10 240m28-240-10 240M338 55l11 240m10-240 11 240m10-240 10 240" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="5"/><g class="how-dimension" fill="none" stroke="#6b6b48" stroke-width="2"><path d="M90 18h320M90 10v16m320-16v16M448 50v250m-8-250h16m-16 250h16"/></g><text class="how-dimension" x="225" y="14" fill="#56573e" font-size="13">WIDTH</text><text class="how-dimension" x="465" y="188" fill="#56573e" font-size="13" transform="rotate(90 465 188)">DROP</text><rect x="155" y="286" width="190" height="9" rx="4" fill="#d6c6ac"/></svg></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Choose a room</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">House of Curtains</p><h2 id="house-of-curtains-title">Bring your rooms together</h2><p class="how-intro">Organise the curtains for different windows in one clear room-by-room view.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Choose a room"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Choose a room</strong><span>Create a room and add the windows you want to work on.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Configure each window"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Configure each window</strong><span>Choose your fabric and curtain details, then use Add to my rooms where offered.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: Review your project"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>Review your project</strong><span>Use Review My Rooms to recheck prices, availability and delivery before proceeding.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/pages/build-my-rooms">Open House of Curtains<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">Rooms are saved in this browser. Ordering depends on each window’s readiness and the current checkout controls.</p></div></article>
<article id="specialists" class="how-panel how-sage" data-guide="specialists" data-stage="0" aria-labelledby="specialists-title"><div class="how-visual"><div class="how-example-tag">ILLUSTRATED WALKTHROUGH <span>07 / 07</span></div><div class="how-demo how-demo-team"><div class="how-team"><img class="" src="{{ 'curtainsuk-adviser-jane.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Jane, AI adviser" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"><img class="" src="{{ 'curtainsuk-adviser-noah.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Noah, AI adviser" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"><img class="" src="{{ 'curtainsuk-adviser-james.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="James, AI adviser" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"><img class="" src="{{ 'curtainsuk-adviser-natalie.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Natalie, AI adviser" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"><img class="" src="{{ 'curtainsuk-adviser-ben.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Ben, AI adviser" width="800" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><div class="how-chat"><span>FABRIC · MEASURING · FITTING</span><p>Start with the subject you need help with.</p></div></div><div class="how-visual-caption" aria-live="polite"><span data-stage-number>01</span><strong data-stage-title>Choose your subject</strong></div><div class="how-demo-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="how-copy"><p class="how-eyebrow">Specialists</p><h2 id="specialists-title">Find the right person to ask</h2><p class="how-intro">Meet the AI advisers for fabric, measuring, fitting and specialist questions.</p><ol class="how-steps"><li><button type="button" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Step 1: Choose your subject"><span class="how-step-number">01</span><span><strong>Choose your subject</strong><span>Jane: fabric and interiors. Noah: measuring. James: fitting. Natalie: specialist windows. Ben: acoustics.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 2: Open the adviser profile"><span class="how-step-number">02</span><span><strong>Open the adviser profile</strong><span>Read their role and follow the consultation entry. Sign in if prompted.</span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Step 3: Explain what you need"><span class="how-step-number">03</span><span><strong>Explain what you need</strong><span>Share the relevant window or fabric context. Follow the consultation and privacy guidance before sending.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class="how-actions"><a class="how-button" href="/pages/meet-our-team">Meet the specialists<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><button class="how-next" type="button" data-next>Next step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><p class="how-note">These are AI advisers. A specialist conversation does not automatically confirm a manufacturing specification.</p></div></article>
</div><aside class="how-bottom"><div><p class="how-eyebrow">A GOOD NEXT STEP</p><h2>See it in your own light.</h2><p>Fabric samples help you judge colour, texture and pattern alongside your own furnishings.</p></div><a class="how-button" href="/pages/fabric-library?view=browse-fabrics">Explore fabrics &amp; samples <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
<noscript><p class="how-note">All seven guides are shown below the feature links. Open the feature links to continue.</p></noscript>
